# Review surface - story CHK-22, capture payment at checkout.
# Honest tier, real prose, and a 'code:' entry that climbs out of the
# directory this manifest sits in. A contributor can write this line in
# a monorepo without thinking twice; the caller's scope never named that
# tree. The build that shipped ten fixtures read the outside file and
# printed 'surface complete', exit 0.
tier: critical
spec: artifacts/checkout.feature
qa: artifacts/checkout.qa.md
code: ../surface-check.py
